:: Whitney Wild Night Window
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
Another pebble hits the glass, and this time you're awake enough to know it isn't rain. You slide out from under the blanket to
cross the room, opening the curtain by an inch.
<br><br>
<span class="purple">Whitney</span> is down in the courtyard, one shoulder against the fence, tossing a third pebble from hand to hand.
<br><br>
<<He>> finds your face in the gap and grins, raising the pebble as if <<he>> is about to throw it at your window.
Instead, <<he>> jerks <<his>> chin towards the ground and mouths the words slowly enough for you to read.
"Get your ass down here. You're suffocating in that fucking cage."
<<if $bedGuest is "Robin">>
	<br><br>
	Robin wakes up behind you and leans into the gap in the curtain. <<nnpc_He "Robin">> takes one look at the courtyard
	and whispers, "Whitney? At this hour?"
	<br><br>
	Whitney sees <<nnpc_him "Robin">> too, and <<his>> mouth makes silent words: <i>what the fuck?</i>
<<elseif $bedGuest is "Kylar">>
	<br><br>
	Kylar wakes up behind you and leans into the gap in the curtain. The moment <<nnpc_he "Kylar">> sees who is out there,
	<<nnpc_his "Kylar">> eyes narrow. Whitney sees <<nnpc_him "Kylar">> too, and the grin only spreads wider. <<He>> holds up a middle finger.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ["Robin", "Kylar"].includes($bedGuest)>>
	<<link [[Sneak out to meet Whitney|Whitney Wild Night Bed Guest]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Sneak out to meet Whitney|Whitney Wild Night Get Dressed]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Close the curtain|Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
