:: Whitney Wild Night Street
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "residential">>
<<effects>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
You cross the courtyard fast, turn sideways at the fence and squeeze through the gap where two boards have been missing for years.
<br><br>
Whitney waits with <<his>> hands shoved in <<his>> pockets, looking you up and down as you stop in front of <<him>>.
"Took you long enough. Thought you'd pissed yourself under the covers, slut. Come on. Move it before Bailey catches us."
<br><br>
<<He>> walks off before you can answer, forcing you to jog after <<him>> until you catch up at the corner. From there <<he>> takes you
through the back lane behind the shops and clears a low wall behind the next house without breaking stride.
You plant both hands on top and scramble over after <<him>>.
<br><br>
Your shoes skid on the wet paving as you drop down. Whitney catches your arm before you hit the concrete,
then releases you the moment your feet are steady and keeps moving.
<br><br>
"Where are we going?" you ask.
<br><br>
Whitney doesn't look back. "Wherever the fuck I want. Keep your mouth shut and keep up."
<br><br>
Two streets later <<he>> stops at the end of an alley. <<His>> hand closes around your wrist, pulling you back
under a shop awning before you can walk out into the open road.
<br><br>
"Look." <<He>> tips <<his>> head towards the other side of the street.
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow <<his>> gaze|Whitney Wild Night Prank]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Prank
<<effects>><<generate2>>
There's a police officer across the road, leaning on a parked car with a paper cup of coffee on the bonnet.
Whitney's grin widens as <<he>> takes out a small bright pill and rolls it between two fingers where you can see it.
"Watch this."
<br><br>
Before you can answer, <<hes>> out from under the awning and across the road, dropping into a crouch behind the car.
<br><br>
The officer turns to answer the radio on <<person2>><<his>> shoulder, and you flatten your hand low against your leg. Whitney catches the warning
and drops behind the boot without a sound.
<br><br>
The officer looks away again, and Whitney moves up the side of the car. <<person1>><<He>> reaches over the bonnet
and drops the <span class="lewd">X-Change pill</span> straight into the cup. When the officer starts to turn, Whitney slides across the bonnet,
lands behind the front wheel and runs back to you while the officer checks the other side of the car for any noises.
