:: Whitney Wild Night Vandalism
<<effects>><<set $bus to "danube">>
Whitney takes your arm and pulls you deeper into the Danube district. The gaps between the streetlights grow wider as the smaller homes
give way to houses hidden behind high walls.
<br><br>
<<He>> passes an empty car park, hops up onto a concrete divider and walks the whole length of it
with both arms out for balance while you keep pace on the ground.
<br><br>
The houses get bigger. <<He>> slows down and starts checking the gates as you pass them.
<br><br>
One has a camera above it, so <<he>> holds up both middle fingers to the lens and keeps walking. The next one doesn't,
and <<he>> reaches through the bars, feels around, and opens it from the inside.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Whitney Wild Night Vandalism 1]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Vandalism 1
<<effects>>
You slip into the front garden while <<he>> eases the gate shut behind you. From behind the hedge, you get your first proper look
at what <<hes>> picked: a pale stone house, flowers planted in neat rows beside the path, and a covered car with not one thing out of place.
<br><br>
Someone pays a lot of money every month to keep it looking exactly like this.
<br><br>
Whitney works along the hedge and checks each downstairs window before coming back to you. Once <<hes>> sure they are all dark,
<<he>> unzips <<his>> jacket and pulls out two cans of spray paint, shaking one beside <<his>> ear to test it.
<br><br>
The other one <<he>> throws hard at your chest, and you catch it against your ribs.
"Make it hurt."
<br><br>
<<He>> walks straight up to the clean stone and sprays a long black line across it. Underneath, <<he>> writes DICKHEAD
in letters as tall as your arm, then steps back and adds an arrow pointing at the largest bedroom window.
<br><br>
Whitney looks back over <<his>> shoulder, raises <<his>> eyebrows and knocks <<his>> knuckles against the wall beside the paint.
"Well? I didn't bring you here to watch."
<br><br>
<<link [[Paint the wall|Whitney Wild Night Accomplice]]>><<set $whitneyWildNight to "vandalism">><<crimeUp 100 "destruction">><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<stress -6>><<pass 2>><</link>><<crime "destruction">><<glove>><<llstress>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse to vandalise it|Whitney Wild Night Vandalism 2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>

