	You follow Whitney into the next street and search among more parked cars, late pedestrians and gardens hidden behind low walls.
	<br><br>
	Your hands haven't stopped shaking since the last one.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Whitney taps the crowbar against <<his>> palm and waits for you to pick.
<br><br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to _stealDifficulty>><<link [[Break into a parked car and steal from it|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Steal]]>><<crimeUp 300 "thievery">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<crime "thievery">>
<br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to _spikeDifficulty>><<link [[Spike someone with an X-Change pill|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Spike]]>><<crimeUp 150 "petty">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<crime "petty">>
<br>
<<link [[Destroy a garden|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Garden]]>><<crimeUp 500 "destruction">><</link>><<crime "destruction">>
<br>
<<link [[Smash up a car|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Car]]>><<crimeUp 900 "destruction">><</link>><<crime "destruction">>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Steal
<<effects>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.action to "steal">><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.rounds += 1>><<set _dangerRoll to random(1, 100)>>
<<if _dangerRoll lte 60>><<set _destructionGain to random(15, 25)>><<set _attentionGain to random(5, 15)>><<set _tier to 1>>
<<elseif _dangerRoll lte 90>><<set _destructionGain to random(30, 45)>><<set _attentionGain to random(15, 30)>><<set _tier to 2>>
<<else>><<set _destructionGain to random(55, 100)>><<set _attentionGain to random(35, 80)>><<set _tier to 3>><</if>>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 750 + (($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds - 1) * 100) + ($whitneyWildNightGame.attention * 3)>>
<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction += _destructionGain>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention += _attentionGain>>
<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if _tier is 3>>
	Whitney picks the most expensive car on the street, parked right under a bedroom window,
	with a coat and a laptop bag on the back seat.
<<elseif _tier is 2>>
	Whitney points out an estate car halfway down the row, with a sat nav still stuck to the windscreen and a child's seat in the back.
<<else>>
	Whitney nods at an old, scruffy little hatchback near the corner. Somebody drives that to work every day and can't afford to lose it.
<</if>>
<br><br>
You crouch down beside it while <<he>> stands over you watching both ends of the road, and slide a strip of metal
down between the glass and the door. Sweat makes the strip slip in your fingers, and every car passing on the main road
makes you stop until its engine fades.
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<br><br>
	The lock pops up without setting off the alarm. You ease the door open and slide into somebody else's car,
	where an air freshener swings above the console and receipts fill the door pocket. After taking the money from the middle compartment,
	you close the door carefully and walk away without hurrying.
	<br><br>
	Whitney counts it, takes half, and pushes the rest into your hand without a word.<<money 500 "thievery">>
	<<skulduggeryuse `$skulduggerydifficulty` "target" 2>>
	<<if _tier is 3>>
		Whoever owns that car is going to come out in the morning to an empty console and no idea who did it.
		<span class="green">That was a big one.</span>
	<<elseif _tier is 2>>
		Whitney bends over laughing and catches your arm, pulling you onwards before anyone notices how easily you got inside.
	<<else>>
		<<He>> shoves you ahead of <<him>> down the pavement, keeping <<his>> body between you and the car. "Don't look back at it. Walk."
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	The horn answers the second you pull the handle, blasting loudly enough to carry along the whole street.
	<br><br>
	Lights start coming on. Whitney doesn't run. <<He>> reaches straight through the open window, rips a wallet out of the console,
	and grabs a fistful of your sleeve. "Move, dumbass!"
	<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention += 20>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.forcePatrol to true>><<money 250 "thievery">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Get away from the car|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Patrol]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Spike
<<effects>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.action to "spike">><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.rounds += 1>><<set _dangerRoll to random(1, 100)>>
<<if _dangerRoll lte 45>><<set _destructionGain to random(20, 30)>><<set _attentionGain to random(8, 18)>><<set _tier to 1>>
<<elseif _dangerRoll lte 85>><<set _destructionGain to random(35, 55)>><<set _attentionGain to random(20, 40)>><<set _tier to 2>>
<<else>><<set _destructionGain to random(65, 100)>><<set _attentionGain to random(45, 90)>><<set _tier to 3>><</if>>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 850 + (($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds - 1) * 100) + ($whitneyWildNightGame.attention * 3)>>
<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction += _destructionGain>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention += _attentionGain>>
<<set _whitneyWildNightVictim to ["resident", "driver", "shopper"].random()>>
<<generate2>>
<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
Whitney puts a bright <span class="lewd">X-Change pill</span> in your palm and folds your fingers over it. You crush it to powder inside your fist
before following <<him>> along the street in search of somebody carrying an open drink.
<br><br><<person2>>
<<if _whitneyWildNightVictim is "driver">>
	You find a <<person>> leaning on <<his>> own car outside a house, phone in one hand, a bottle balanced on the roof beside <<him>>.
<<elseif _whitneyWildNightVictim is "shopper">>
	You find a <<person>> walking home with a bag in each hand and a bottle wedged under one arm, both hands too full to check it.
<<else>>
	You find a <<person>> on <<his>> way back from the pub, talking to nobody, a drink in one hand.
<</if>>
<<He>> has no idea you're there. In a few minutes <<he>> will be somebody else, and <<he>> will never find out why.
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<br><br>
	You pass close behind <<him>> and tip the powder into the drink without touching <<him>>. Keeping the same pace,
	you carry on to the corner, <<person1>>where Whitney has both hands over <<his>> mouth
	and <<his>> shoulders are shaking.
	<br><br>
	<<skulduggeryuse `$skulduggerydifficulty` "target" 2>>
	<<if !Array.isArray($whitneyWildNightSpikes)>><<set $whitneyWildNightSpikes to []>><</if>>
	<<run $whitneyWildNightSpikes.push({ role: _whitneyWildNightVictim, pronoun: $NPCList[1].pronoun })>>
	<<if _tier is 3>>
		<<person2>>Behind you, <<he>> takes a long drink and carries on walking.
		<span class="lewd"><<He>> will not be the same person when <<he>> gets home.</span>
	<<elseif _tier is 2>>
		Whitney grabs your face with both hands. "You didn't even touch anyone. That was fucking perfect."
	<<else>>
		"Don't stand there watching," Whitney says, pulling you round the corner. "That's how people get caught."
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	The bottle tips as your hand passes over it. <<He>> turns and catches you with your fingers above the opening
	and white powder still on your thumb, <<his>> expression changing as <<he>> works out what you tried to do.
	<br><br>
	Whitney kicks the bottle away into the road, where it smashes, and pulls you off down the pavement
	while the <<print _whitneyWildNightVictim>> behind you shouts for someone to call the police.
	<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention += 25>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.forcePatrol to true>>
<</if>>
<<person1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Get off the street|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Patrol]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Garden
<<effects>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.action to "garden">><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.rounds += 1>><<set _dangerRoll to random(1, 100)>>
<<if _dangerRoll lte 30>><<set _destructionGain to random(25, 35)>><<set _attentionGain to random(12, 25)>><<set _tier to 1>>
<<elseif _dangerRoll lte 75>><<set _destructionGain to random(45, 65)>><<set _attentionGain to random(30, 55)>><<set _tier to 2>>
<<else>><<set _destructionGain to random(75, 100)>><<set _attentionGain to random(60, 100)>><<set _tier to 3>><</if>>
<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction += _destructionGain>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention += _attentionGain>>
<<set _whitneyWildNightMistake to random(1, 100)>><<set _whitneyWildNightMistakeChance to 10 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 5)>>
You go over the garden wall first, then reach back to pull Whitney up after you. A moment later you're both standing
on someone's lawn, with a family asleep behind the windows above you.
<br><br>
You put your foot through the first pot in the row beside the path, then kick through the next before the noise can make you hesitate.
Whitney follows along the border, ripping out each garden light and throwing it over the hedge into the road.
<br><br>
You get the crowbar under the arm of a wooden bench and lean on it until the wood breaks.
<br><br>
<<He>> stamps through the middle of a flowerbed, kicking plants from the soil before lifting a stone ornament with both arms
and dropping it into the fountain.
<br><br>
<<if _tier is 3>>
	After that you stop being careful, swinging the crowbar through the greenhouse panels until the glass falls in sheets.
	Whitney gets both hands on a young tree and pulls until the roots tear out of the ground, then drags the whole thing across the path.
	By the time you stop, everything out here is broken, bent or lying somewhere it shouldn't be.
	<br><br>
	<span class="purple">Somebody spent years on this garden. It took you four minutes.</span>
<<elseif _tier is 2>>
	You get the crowbar into a trellis on the house wall, pulling at it until it comes off in pieces. The climbing plant
	that took years to grow up it comes down with it. You leave broken pots all over the front garden,
	water spreading out of the fountain and down the path.
<<else>>
	You move quickly, leaving soil across the path, the bench broken in half and the flowerbed flattened.
	Both of you are back at the wall before anything moves upstairs.
<</if>>
<<if _whitneyWildNightMistake lte _whitneyWildNightMistakeChance>>
	<br><br>
	Then something you've thrown hits the security light above the door. It smashes, and half a second later the house alarm goes off
	and the whole street lights up.<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to 100>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Climb back over the wall|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Patrol]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Car
<<effects>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.action to "car">><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.rounds += 1>><<set _dangerRoll to random(1, 100)>>
<<if _dangerRoll lte 20>><<set _destructionGain to random(30, 45)>><<set _attentionGain to random(20, 35)>><<set _tier to 1>>
<<elseif _dangerRoll lte 60>><<set _destructionGain to random(55, 75)>><<set _attentionGain to random(40, 65)>><<set _tier to 2>>
<<else>><<set _destructionGain to random(85, 100)>><<set _attentionGain to random(70, 100)>><<set _tier to 3>><</if>>
<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction += _destructionGain>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention += _attentionGain>>
<<set _whitneyWildNightMistake to random(1, 100)>><<set _whitneyWildNightMistakeChance to 18 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 7)>>
Whitney chooses a car outside a dark house and wedges the crowbar behind its wing mirror.
"Push," <<he>> says. You lean on it together until the plastic snaps and the mirror drops into the road, skidding beneath the car.
<br><br>
There's no point being quiet now, so you stop trying.
<br><br>
You drag the crowbar along both doors, producing a loud metal screech while the paint curls away in a silver line.
Beside you, Whitney climbs onto the bonnet and starts jumping.
<br><br>
The metal gives under <<his>> boots. <<He>> keeps jumping until the middle of it is caved in and won't come back up.
<br><br>
<<if _tier is 3>>
	Then <<he>> hands you the crowbar and tells you to finish it. You smash both back lights before driving the bar through the rear window,
	spreading glass across the seats, road and your own shoes. Once it is down, you move around to the headlights.
	<br><br>
	Whitney kicks the number plate off and sends it spinning down the street, then cuts both tyres on this side flat with a knife
	you didn't know <<he>> had. When you finally stop, the car is leaning over on two flat tyres, surrounded by broken glass,
	and it is never going to be driven again. <span class="red">That is somebody's entire savings, and it took two minutes.</span>
<<elseif _tier is 2>>
	You put the crowbar through both lights on this side, then knock the wipers off. Whitney bends the aerial flat
	and kicks the plastic trim off the bottom of the doors. Every panel on this side of the car is scratched, dented or missing something.
	Nobody is fixing that cheaply.
<<else>>
	You leave it there, with the mirror gone, both doors scratched along their full length and the bonnet pushed in.
	Whitney drops from the front of the car beside you, breathing hard as <<he>> grins at the damage.
<</if>>
<<if _whitneyWildNightMistake lte _whitneyWildNightMistakeChance>>
	<br><br>
	Then you swing at the windscreen. The whole thing goes white with cracks and bits of glass spray across the seats,
	and the alarm goes off right in your face, so loud that it hurts. A light comes on above a door across the road.
	<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to 100>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Run from the car|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Patrol]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Patrol
<<effects>>
<<if $whitneyWildNightGame.rounds is undefined>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.rounds to 1>><</if>>
<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction to Math.clamp($whitneyWildNightGame.destruction, 0, 100)>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.clamp($whitneyWildNightGame.attention, 0, 100)>>
<<set _whitneyWildNightPatrolChance to Math.min(95, 10 + $whitneyWildNightGame.attention + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 6))>>
<<set _whitneyWildNightPatrol to $whitneyWildNightGame.forcePatrol or random(1, 100) lte _whitneyWildNightPatrolChance>>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 850 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.attention * 6) + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 100)>>
<<set _runMin to 500 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 100)>><<set _runMax to Math.min(2400, 1300 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.attention * 8) + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 125))>>
<<run delete $whitneyWildNightGame.forcePatrol>>
<<if $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction gte 100 or $whitneyWildNightGame.attention gte 100>>
	<<if $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction gte 100>>
		You have made far too much noise for one street. Doors are opening behind you, and you don't even reach the corner
		before a police car swings in ahead of you and its lights come on.
	<<else>>
		Somebody has phoned it in. You don't reach the corner before a police car swings in ahead of you and its lights come on.
	<</if>>
	Blue light passes over the houses and the damage you left behind.
	<br><br>
	Whitney looks at you, then at the alley on the other side of the road.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Run before the officers get out|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Chase]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _whitneyWildNightPatrol>>
	A police car drives across the far end of the road. Whitney throws an arm across your chest
	and pulls you behind a delivery van before its headlights reach the corner.
	<br><br>
	"Pick one," <<he>> whispers. "Hide or run."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Hide and wait for the car to pass|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Hide]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Run through the back streets|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Run]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty _runMin _runMax>>
<<else>>
	You're both out of the street before a single door opens behind you. Whitney checks the road one last time,
	then grins and slings the crowbar back over <<his>> shoulder.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Choose what to do next|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Decision]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Hide
<<effects>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 850 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.attention * 6) + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 100)>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
You crouch behind the van with Whitney pressed against your side, watching the police car's tyres through the gap underneath
while you hold your breath.
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<br><br>
	The car rolls past and keeps going. Whitney waits until the engine has faded out at the end of the road,
	then takes your hand and pulls you into the next alley.
	<span class="green">You avoid the police.</span><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.max(0, $whitneyWildNightGame.attention - 10)>>
	<<skulduggeryuse `$skulduggerydifficulty` "target" 2>>
	<<link [[Move on|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Decision]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	Your shoe catches a bottle and sends it rolling from beneath the van. It knocks against the kerb loudly enough to carry down the street,
	and the police car stops.
	<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.min(100, $whitneyWildNightGame.attention + 30)>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Run|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Chase]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Run
<<set _runMin to 500 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 100)>><<set _runMax to Math.min(2400, 1300 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.attention * 8) + ($whitneyWildNightGame.rounds * 125))>><<effects>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<athleticsdifficulty _runMin _runMax f>>
You break cover together and run straight across the road. A shout and an opening car door follow you,
then boots strike the tarmac as you jump a low fence and cut through somebody's side yard.
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<br><br>
	You land beside Whitney and keep going. <<He>> pulls a bin over behind you, blocking the whole narrow path.
	By the next corner there's nobody behind you at all. <span class="green">You escape.</span><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.max(0, $whitneyWildNightGame.attention - 5)>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Keep moving|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Decision]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	Your foot catches the top of the fence and you go down hard on the other side, all the wind knocked out of you.
	An officer is already at the gate. Whitney doubles back, grabs you by the back of your clothes and drags you upright
	half a second before a hand closes on your arm.<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.min(100, $whitneyWildNightGame.attention + 35)>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Keep running|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Chase]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Chase
<<effects>>
<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak to {
	progress: 0, turns: 0, action: "none", police: random(2, 4), policeDir: random(1, 2) is 1 ? -1 : 1,
	alert: $whitneyWildNightGame.attention gte 75 ? 2 : 1, whitneySave: true
}>>
The police car brakes hard behind you, and two officers are out in the road before you reach the next gate.
One is already speaking into a radio, calling for more of them, when Whitney catches your sleeve and pulls you into a garden.
<br><br>
"Keep low," <<he>> says. "We get through the next four streets and we lose them."
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow Whitney|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Sneak]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Sneak
<<effects>>
<<set _sneak to $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak>><<set _caught to false>>
<<if !_sneak or typeof _sneak isnot "object">>
	<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak to { progress: 0, turns: 0, action: "none", police: 3, policeDir: 1, alert: 1, whitneySave: true }>><<set _sneak to $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak>>
<</if>>
<<set _distance to Math.abs(_sneak.police - _sneak.progress)>>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 800 + ($whitneyWildNightGame.attention * 4) + (_sneak.turns * 100) + (_sneak.alert * 100)>>
<<if _sneak.turns is 0 and _sneak.action is "none">>
	Behind you the police are spreading out through the streets. One of them is standing over the mess you made,
	talking into a radio. Another is pointing towards the gardens you just came through.
	<br><br>
	"They went this way," someone calls, and a torch beam starts sweeping along the walls and gates ahead of you.
	Whitney drops into a crouch at your shoulder and watches it through the gap under a parked car.
	<br><br>
	"They're looking for us now," <<he>> whispers. "Move when you're ready."
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<switch _sneak.action>>
	<<case "dash">>
		You leave cover and sprint across the open road.
		<<if _distance lte 1>>
			<<if _sneak.whitneySave>>
				<<set _sneak.whitneySave to false>><<set _sneak.alert to Math.min(4, _sneak.alert + 1)>>
				A hand closes on your collar, pulling you backwards behind a parked van. An officer walks round the corner
				into the space where you were about to be.
				<br><br>
				"Watch where you're fucking going!" Whitney snarls in your ear. <span class="red">Whitney will not be able to save you again.</span>
			<<else>>
				You're halfway across when an officer sees you and shouts to the others.<<set _caught to true>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			You get two whole streets behind you before the police reach the corner. <span class="green">You move quickly.</span><<set _sneak.progress += 2>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<<case "sneak">>
		You keep close to the garden walls and move from one parked car to the next.<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
		<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
			You reach the next street without making a sound, keeping clear of every torch beam. <span class="green">Clean move.</span><<set _sneak.progress += 1>><<skulduggeryuse `$skulduggerydifficulty` "target" 2>>
		<<elseif random(1, 100) lte 60>>
			Your shoe scrapes the kerb. An officer stops walking and stands there listening, but you're behind the next wall before <<he>> gets round.<<set _sneak.progress += 1>><<set _sneak.alert to Math.min(4, _sneak.alert + 1)>>
		<<elseif _sneak.whitneySave>>
			<<set _sneak.whitneySave to false>><<set _sneak.progress += 1>><<set _sneak.alert to Math.min(4, _sneak.alert + 1)>>
			A bottle rolls under your foot. Whitney kicks it away into somebody's garden before it can hit the wall,
			and the torches all swing over there while the two of you go the other way.
			<br><br>
			"Owe me one," <<he>> mutters.
		<<else>>
			A torch beam swings between two cars and lands right on you. "Stop there!"<<set _caught to true>>
		<</if>>
	<<case "hide">>
		You pull Whitney into a doorway, where both of you press flat against the recessed door.
		<<if _distance lte 1 and _sneak.alert gte 2>>
			<<if _sneak.whitneySave>>
				<<set _sneak.whitneySave to false>><<set _sneak.alert to Math.max(1, _sneak.alert - 1)>>
				An officer starts walking straight at the doorway. Whitney throws a stone across the road behind <<him>>.
				It hits a wall, and the officer turns to go after the noise instead.
			<<else>>
				A torch comes into the doorway and finds the two of you standing there.<<set _caught to true>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			The officer crosses the end of the street without ever looking down it. You wait until the footsteps are gone.
			<span class="green">Police alert falls.</span><<set _sneak.alert to Math.max(0, _sneak.alert - 1)>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<<default>>
<</switch>>
<<if !_caught and _sneak.progress lt 4 and _sneak.action isnot "none">>
	<<set _sneak.police += _sneak.policeDir>>
	<<if _sneak.police gte 5>><<set _sneak.police to 5>><<set _sneak.policeDir to -1>>
	<<elseif _sneak.police lte 0>><<set _sneak.police to 0>><<set _sneak.policeDir to 1>><</if>>
	<<set _sneak.turns += 1>>
<</if>>
<<set _sneak.action to "none">>
<<if _caught>>
	<br><br>
	The officer shouts for help, and boots come running from both ends of the street at once.
	Whitney makes a grab for your arm, but somebody bigger gets to you first.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Caught]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _sneak.progress gte 4>>
	You cross the last road and squeeze through a gap in a broken fence, with Whitney pulling the boards back into place behind you.
	Torch beams continue along the wrong street on the other side while you crouch together in the dark and catch your breath.
	<span class="green">You lose them.</span>
	<<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.max(0, $whitneyWildNightGame.attention - 20)>><<run delete $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Catch your breath|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Decision]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _distance to Math.abs(_sneak.police - _sneak.progress)>>
	<<switch _sneak.progress>>
		<<case 0>><span class="pink">Four streets remain between you and safety.</span>
		<<case 1>><span class="purple">You have crossed the first street.</span>
		<<case 2>><span class="blue">You are halfway through the back streets.</span>
		<<case 3>><span class="teal">One more street remains.</span>
	<</switch>>
	<br>
	<<switch _sneak.alert>>
		<<case 0>><span class="green">The police are searching somewhere else.</span>
		<<case 1>><span class="purple">The police are checking the nearby streets.</span>
		<<case 2>><span class="pink">The police know you are close.</span>
		<<default>><span class="red">The police are closing in.</span>
	<</switch>>
	<br>
	<<if _distance lte 1>><span class="red">You hear an officer close to your route.</span>
	<<elseif _distance is 2>><span class="pink">You hear footsteps on the next street.</span>
	<<else>><span class="teal">The nearest footsteps sound far away.</span><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<caveicon "north">><<link [[Dash forward|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Sneak]]>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak.action to "dash">><</link>><<note "Fast, risky" "pink">>
	<br>
	<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[Sneak forward|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Sneak]]>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak.action to "sneak">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
	<<crimeicon>><<link [[Hide|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Sneak]]>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.sneak.action to "hide">><</link>><<note "Lower police alert" "teal">>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Decision
<<effects>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction to Math.clamp($whitneyWildNightGame.destruction, 0, 100)>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.clamp($whitneyWildNightGame.attention, 0, 100)>>
<span class="red">Destruction:</span> <meter min="0" max="100" @value="$whitneyWildNightGame.destruction"></meter> $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction / 100
<br>
<span class="blue">Police attention:</span> <meter min="0" max="100" @value="$whitneyWildNightGame.attention"></meter> $whitneyWildNightGame.attention / 100
<br><br>
<<if $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction gte 100>>
	You can hear it from here. Two car alarms going at once, a dog that won't stop, and somewhere behind you a woman shouting
	for someone to phone the police. You've turned a quiet street into a crime scene.
<<elseif $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction gte 60>>
	Behind you, broken glass covers the road while an alarm continues ringing and lights come on in three houses.
	People are going to be talking about tonight for a week.
<<else>>
	Behind you the street is still dark and quiet. Nobody has found the damage yet. Somebody will in the morning.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Whitney looks back the way you came, grinning, and holds the crowbar out to you.
<br><br>
<<if $whitneyWildNightGame.destruction gte 100>>
	"That's enough," <<he>> says. "The whole fucking district is awake."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Leave with Whitney|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Escape]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $whitneyWildNightGame.attention gte 60>>
		"Police are all over this side of town now," <<he>> says. "So we go one street further out. Unless you're scared."
	<<else>>
		"We can keep going," <<he>> says. "Unless you're scared."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Find another target|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Choices]]>><<set $whitneyWildNightGame.attention to Math.min(100, $whitneyWildNightGame.attention + 5)>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stop while you can|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Escape]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Caught
<<effects>><<unset $whitneyWildNightGame>>
An officer gets a fistful of your clothes before you've gone two steps, and a second one takes your wrist
and folds your arm up behind your back until you stop fighting it.
<br><br>
Whitney stops at the end of the alley and looks back at you. For one second you think <<he>>'s going to come back for you.
Then more doors open on the police car. <<He>> swears, turns, runs between the houses,
while they walk you the other way towards the road.
<br><br>
<<if crimeSumCurrent() gte 5000>>
	They check your record on the screen in the car, and whatever comes up on it, the mood changes.
	One of them looks back at you over the seat. "Straight to prison for this one."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Police Prison Intro]]>><<endevent>><<generatePolice 1>><<generatePolice 2>><<pass 30>><</link>>
<<else>>
	They put cuffs on you, push your head down and sit you in the back of the car. You watch the wrecked street go past the window
	all the way to the station, where they take your things off you and lock you in a cell.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Police Cell]]>><<pass 1 hour>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Escape
<<effects>>
Whitney pulls you behind a wall, where the two of you listen for engines or footsteps. When none follow,
<<he>> bends over with <<his>> hands on <<his>> knees and laughs into <<his>> sleeve
until <<he>> can't breathe.
<br><br>
<<if $whitneyWildNightGame.attention gte 60>>
	"That was fucking close." <<He>> takes you by the waist and puts you against the wall. "You still picked a good one."
<<else>>
	"Not bad." <<He>> takes you by the waist and puts you against the wall. "You still picked a good one."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> kisses you, paint and dirt still all over <<his>> hands, then takes hold of one of yours<<takeKissVirginity "Whitney" "loveInterest">>
and walks you home the long way, through the back streets, where nobody will see either of you.
<<stress -12>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<llstress>><<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Go home with Whitney (0:20)|Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Return]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Repeat Vandalism Return
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<set $bus to "home">><<effects>><<unset $whitneyWildNightGame>>
Whitney takes the long route back and checks the orphanage courtyard before waving you through the fence.
<br><br>
The second you get a foot on the trellis, <<he>> slaps your ass. "Keep your schedule open."<<arousal 100>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
<<He>> steps back into the dark to watch you climb. <<He>> only goes once you're through the window, out of sight.
<br><br>
<<link [[Go back to bed|Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Followup
<<effects>>
/* Spikes are stored as {role, pronoun}. Saves made before that change hold a bare role string with no pronoun recorded. */
<<if _whitneyWildNightVictim and typeof _whitneyWildNightVictim is "object">>
	<<set _victimRole to _whitneyWildNightVictim.role>><<set _victimPronoun to _whitneyWildNightVictim.pronoun>>
<<else>>
	<<set _victimRole to _whitneyWildNightVictim>>
<</if>>
/* The stored pronoun is who they were when you spiked them. The pill has since flipped their sex, so the crowd sees the opposite. */
<<if _victimPronoun is "m">><<set _victimPronoun to "f">>
<<elseif _victimPronoun is "f">><<set _victimPronoun to "m">>
<<else>><<set _victimPronoun to (random(1, 2) is 1 ? "m" : "f")>><</if>>
<<generateNPC 1 "a" _victimPronoun>><<person1>>
A crowd blocks the pavement ahead, forcing you into the road until you find a gap between two people and squeeze through to see what happened.
<br><br>
<<switch _victimRole>>
	<<case "officer">>
		There's a police officer in the middle of it all. <span class="lewd">The officer has been X-Changed.</span>
		<br><br>
		It's the same uniform you saw the other night, but it doesn't fit <<him>> any more. The shirt is pulled tight in places
		it shouldn't be, hanging loose in others. <<His>> face doesn't match the photo on the badge clipped to the pocket.
		Neither does <<his>> voice.
		<br><br>
		"Stop staring," <<he>> snaps, then pauses at the sound of <<his>> changed voice. <<He>> turns both hands over
		before checking the photograph on the badge again, then a third time. But nobody in the crowd moves; they whisper and point,
		and a couple of them are filming.
		<br><br>
		There's a dried brown coffee stain down one sleeve. You think about Whitney crouched behind that car,
		and you have to look at the ground so nobody sees your face.
	<<case "resident">>
		A local <<person>> is standing next to a bench, holding a coat shut around a body that isn't the one <<he>> left home in.
		<span class="lewd">The resident has been X-Changed.</span> There's an ID card face up on the pavement where <<he>> dropped it,
		and the photo on it is a stranger now.
		<br><br>
		"There's nothing to see," <<he>> keeps saying to anyone who will listen, but the crowd does not move.
	<<case "driver">>
		A driver is arguing with a police officer beside a parked car, getting louder every second.
		<span class="lewd">The driver has been X-Changed.</span> The name and the photo on the licence in <<his>> hand belong to somebody
		who doesn't exist any more, and the officer keeps looking from one to the other.
		<br><br>
		"It's my car," <<he>> says, hitting the window with <<his>> hand. "My keys are in my hand. What else do you want from me?"
	<<default>>
		A <<person>> is standing in the middle of <<his>> own dropped shopping. <span class="lewd">The shopper has been X-Changed.</span>
		<<His>> clothes are pulled tight across a body that's the wrong shape for <<him>> now, and <<hes>> going through every bag
		looking for anything else to put on.
		<br><br>
		"Put those phones away!" <<he>> shouts, but nobody listens.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Clout
<<effects>><<npc Whitney>><<generatey2>><<generatey3>>
You're walking down the corridor when a <<person2>><<person>> steps into your path, holding a phone out towards you.
<br><br>
"That's <<phim>>," <<person2>><<he>> says to the <<person3>><<person>> beside <<person2>><<him>>.
"That's the one who was out with Whitney."
<br><br>
<<person3>>"Whoa. Wait, really?" The <<person>> looks you up and down. "You were there? For the whole thing?"
<br><br>
<<switch random(1, 3)>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<person2>>The <<person>> turns the phone around. On the screen is a photo of a shop shutter covered in fresh paint,
		taken from across the road in the dark. "Someone put it up this morning. Half the school's seen it by now."
	<<case 2>>
		<<person2>>The <<person>> lowers <<his>> voice. "My friends walked past that street the next morning.
		Said they had two people out there scrubbing it and it still didn't come off."
	<<case 3>>
		<<person2>>The <<person>> grins. "Everyone's saying the police drove right past you and didn't even stop.
		Is that true? Did you actually run?"
<</switch>>
<br><br>
More students slow down as they pass, until there's a small group of them standing around you.
A few hang back and just watch, but the rest keep asking questions over each other,
and none of them wait long enough for you to answer.<<gcool>><<status 4>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Whitney Wild Night Clout 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Wild Night Clout 2
<<effects>>
<<person1>>Whitney is further down the corridor with <<his>> friends. <<He>> notices the crowd, then notices you in the middle of it.
<<He>> stops talking and watches for a moment.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Whitney.love gte 40>>
	<<He>> catches your eye and winks at you, making sure you see it. Then <<he>> turns and walks off down the hall
	without saying a word.
<<else>>
	<<He>> catches your eye and winks at you, then turns and walks off down the hall like none of it has anything to do with <<him>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The students around you notice where <<hes>> going. One by one they peel away from you and follow after <<him>>,
until you're standing on your own in the middle of the corridor.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Whitney.dom gte 40>>
	You're left with the feeling that <<he>> just showed everyone exactly who they should be looking at.<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
<<else>>
	The corridor noise closes back over the empty space where they were standing.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

